We can implement this in six phases.
1. Launch EC2
   - Ubuntu 24.04 LTS
   - g5.xlarge
   - 100 GB gp3 EBS
   - Allocate an Elastic IP if you need a stable public endpoint.
2. Install NVIDIA drivers and Docker
   
   Install the GPU drivers and verify that the EC2 instance recognizes the GPU.
3. Install Ollama
   
   Install Ollama and download the Llama model.
4. Test the LLM
   
   Test the model through Ollama CLI and its REST API.
5. Install Open WebUI
   
   Run Open WebUI using Docker and connect it to Ollama.
